{
  "id": "E042",
  "title": "I'm Pregnant",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2016-08-17",
  "synopsis": "In China there are many different ways of predicting the gender of your future child.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/203/9032a329ead0ce11780705119ecd48cd66ce6946.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我怀孕了\n\n王太太：我今天很想吃四川菜。\n王先生：你昨天也很想吃四川菜。\n王太太：我前天也很想吃四川菜。\n王先生：你什么时候这么爱吃四川菜了？\n王太太：我也不知道，只要是辣的都好吃。\n王先生：只想吃辣的吗？\n王太太：是啊。有什么不对吗？\n王先生：你再想想？\n王太太：我不会是怀孕了吧？\n王先生：酸儿辣女，咱们要有女儿了！",
    "traditional": "我懷孕了\n\n王太太：我今天很想吃四川菜。\n王先生：你昨天也很想吃四川菜。\n王太太：我前天也很想吃四川菜。\n王先生：你什麼時候這麼愛吃四川菜了？\n王太太：我也不知道，只要是辣的都好吃。\n王先生：只想吃辣的嗎？\n王太太：是啊。有什麼不對嗎？\n王先生：你再想想？\n王太太：我不會是懷孕了吧？\n王先生：酸兒辣女，咱們要有女兒了！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I'm Pregnant"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "王太太：我今天很想吃四川菜。",
      "traditional": "王太太：我今天很想吃四川菜。",
      "pinyin": "wáng tài tai wǒ jīn tiān hěn xiǎng chī sì chuān cài",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mrs. Wang: I really want to eat Sichuan food today."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "王先生：你昨天也很想吃四川菜。",
      "traditional": "王先生：你昨天也很想吃四川菜。",
      "pinyin": "wáng xiān sheng nǐ zuó tiān yě hěn xiǎng chī sì chuān cài",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mr. Wang: You wanted Sichuan food yesterday."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "王太太：我前天也很想吃四川菜。",
      "traditional": "王太太：我前天也很想吃四川菜。",
      "pinyin": "wáng tài tai wǒ qián tiān yě hěn xiǎng chī sì chuān cài",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mrs. Wang: I wanted Sichuan food the day before yesterday as well."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "王先生：你什么时候这么爱吃四川菜了？",
      "traditional": "王先生：你什麼時候這麼愛吃四川菜了？",
      "pinyin": "wáng xiān sheng nǐ shén me shí hou zhè me ài chī sì chuān cài le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mr. Wang: When did you start loving Sichuan food so much?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "王太太：我也不知道，只要是辣的都好吃。",
      "traditional": "王太太：我也不知道，只要是辣的都好吃。",
      "pinyin": "wáng tài tai wǒ yě bù zhī dào zhǐ yào shì là de dōu hǎo chī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mrs. Wang: I don't know. As long as it's spicy I like it."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "王先生：只想吃辣的吗？",
      "traditional": "王先生：只想吃辣的嗎？",
      "pinyin": "wáng xiān sheng zhǐ xiǎng chī là de ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mr. Wang: You only want spicy food?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "王太太：是啊。有什么不对吗？",
      "traditional": "王太太：是啊。有什麼不對嗎？",
      "pinyin": "wáng tài tai shì a yǒu shén me bú duì ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mrs. Wang: Yes. Is there something wrong with that?"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "王先生：你再想想？",
      "traditional": "王先生：你再想想？",
      "pinyin": "wáng xiān sheng nǐ zài xiǎng xiǎng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mr. Wang: Think about it one more time?"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "王太太：我不会是怀孕了吧？",
      "traditional": "王太太：我不會是懷孕了吧？",
      "pinyin": "wáng tài tai wǒ bú huì shì huái yùn le ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mrs. Wang: I can't be pregnant, can I?"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "王先生：酸儿辣女，咱们要有女儿了！",
      "traditional": "王先生：酸兒辣女，咱們要有女兒了！",
      "pinyin": "wáng xiān sheng suān ér là nǚ zán men yào yǒu nǚ ér le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mr. Wang: Sour for a boy, spicy for a girl! We are having a girl!"
    }
  ],
